    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Bundled pricing snapshot for the limit-order engine:\\n`(ibt_rate, future_pt_value, maturity)` in a single cross-contract call.\\n\\nThe engine otherwise reads these via ~7 separate calls (PT `get_ibt`,\\nIBT `decimals`, vault `query_asset`, underlying `decimals`, PT\\n`get_ibt_rate`, PT `preview_redeem`, PT `maturity`) \\xe2\\x80\\x94 each re-instantiating\\nthe target contract, which on a heavy IBT (Blend pool / Upshift vault)\\ndominates per-fill memory. Folding them into one PT invocation (with one\\ninternal vault read) removes those redundant instantiations.",
      "name": "pricing_data",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "tuple": {
            "value_types": [
              "i128",
              "i128",
              "u64"
